WindowAgg  (cost=158.70..198.06 rows=2260 width=12)
  Window: w1 AS (ORDER BY x)
  ->  Sort  (cost=158.51..164.16 rows=2260 width=8)
        Sort Key: x
        ->  Seq Scan on ee_b  (cost=0.00..32.60 rows=2260 width=8)
