Seq Scan on ee_b  (cost=38.26..76.51 rows=11 width=8)
  Filter: (x = (InitPlan 1).col1)
  InitPlan 1
    ->  Aggregate  (cost=38.25..38.26 rows=1 width=4)
          ->  Seq Scan on ee_b ee_b_1  (cost=0.00..32.60 rows=2260 width=4)
